s of weapons and accessories and see a unit\u2019s playstyle change drastically.<br></li><li> Travel the land of Vanaris to discover powerful treasures and hear untold stories. However, keep your guard up as danger lurks in every corner.<br></li><li> Unravel the story through fifteen unique story encounters and hand-crafted in-game cutscenes, as well as optional battles and boss fights.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599860/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1726133447\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599860/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1726133447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599860/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1726133447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
